### Data Quality Issue

The dataset contained **duplicate Transaction IDs**, meaning Transaction ID could not reliably serve as a unique identifier.

To resolve this issue, an **Index Key** was created in Power Query to uniquely identify each record.

Other data preparation activities included:

- Standardizing text values
- Standardizing data types
- Creating two additional analytical columns
- Preparing the dataset for analysis
- Validating the cleaned dataset

> **Data Quality Note:** The source dataset contains 1,498 records, while the dashboard reports 1,491 cars sold. This difference should be reconciled and documented as part of the final data-quality review.

