## 3. Sales by Location

| Location | Cars Sold | Growth Rate |
|---|---:|---:|
| Lagos | 361 | 3.74% |
| Osun | 337 | 3.69% |
| Ogun | 336 | 3.70% |
| Oyo | 224 | 5.66% 
| Ondo | 216 | 5.88% |
